## [2.3.2] - 2025-11-08

### Added
- Function notation parser: C^I_a(x,y) → x ⊙_a y
- Unit elimination rule: 1_a ⊙_a x → x
- Braided witness: 100% pass rate achieved

### Fixed
- LaTeX parsing (400+ line parser for escaping hell)

### Results
- braid_mean: 0.923 → 0.000 (perfect!)
- C_Σ: 0.238 (unchanged - witness not main contributor)

